  "source": "module alu(input [7:0] a, b, input [1:0] op,\n           output [7:0] y, output equal, less);\n  wire [7:0] added, masked, shifted;\n  assign added = a + b;\n  assign masked = a ^ b;\n  assign shifted = a << b;\n  assign y = op == 2'd0 ? added :\n             op == 2'd1 ? a - b :\n             op == 2'd2 ? masked : shifted;\n  assign equal = a == b;\n  assign less = a < b;\nendmodule\n"
